      "text": "whether the host retries a failed provider request itself. Measured here: a persistent 500 was sent 6, 6 time(s) in its 2 admitted attempt(s); a first 429 was followed by 1 further request(s) within its admitted attempt(s). Measured in the 2026-09-23 spike, not by this probe: a header timeout (headerTimeout 3000 ms) was sent 6 times. The network-error case comes from reading the host binary, not from a measurement. A source search found no switch to turn the loop off; that search does not prove no switch exists"
    },
