      "id": "F3",
      "text": "host tools are offered by default; with one tool step, 2 physical request(s) stood behind the admitted attempt(s), and MAD recorded 1002 in / 12 out; the stub served 2003 in / 23 out (scenario `host-tool step`)"
    },
    {
      "id": "N2",
      "text": "with only StructuredOutput offered (`tools: {\"*\":false,\"StructuredOutput\":true}`), a stub answer that called another tool left 2 physical request(s) behind the admitted attempt(s), and MAD recorded 1002 in / 12 out; the stub served 2003 in / 23 out (scenario `unoffered tool`). Whether a real provider emits such a call under `tool_choice: \"required\"` is not established"
    },
